Package: seglcd
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         libhidapi-hidraw0,
         polkitd
Description: tools and service for the Thermaltake LB360-S segment LCD
 SegLcd drives the segment LCD on the pump block of the Thermaltake
 LB360-S ARGB Sync AIO cooler (USB 5131:200e) on Linux.
 .
  * seglcd: CLI for testing, sending and analysing packets
  * seglcdd: system service showing the CPU and GPU temperature live on the
    display, with a D-Bus interface (io.github.fubar_coder.SegLcd1)
 .
 SegLcd is not affiliated with Thermaltake.

Package: seglcd-gtk
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         seglcd (= ${binary:Version}),
         libgtk-4-1,
         libadwaita-1-0 (>= 1.6)
Description: GTK settings app for the SegLcd service
 seglcd-gtk shows the state of the SegLcd service and the current sensor
 values of the Thermaltake LB360-S segment LCD, and sets the intervals and
 the sensor of each value over D-Bus.
 .
 SegLcd is not affiliated with Thermaltake.
